{"id":"crochet","lemma":"crochet","pos":"noun","rank":3839,"glosses":["hook (rod bent into a curved shape)","square bracket","fang (of snake)"],"ipa":"/kʁɔ.ʃɛ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/17/Fr-crochet.ogg/Fr-crochet.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"crochets"},"formAudio":{"crochets":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/06/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-crochets.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Suspends ton manteau au crochet.","en":"Hang your coat on the hook.","words":[{"g":"to suspend","l":"suspendre"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"coat"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Il vit encore aux crochets de ses parents.","en":"He's still sponging off his parents.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"still"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"relative","l":"parent"}]},{"text":"Pose ta veste sur le crochet près de la porte.","en":"Hang your jacket on the hook by the door.","words":[{"g":"to stop carrying","l":"poser"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"jacket"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / it"},null,null,null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"door"}],"phrases":[[6,8,"close to, near."]]},{"text":"Suspendez votre manteau au crochet.","en":"Hang your coat on the hook.","words":[{"g":"to suspend","l":"suspendre"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},{"g":"coat"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Le serpent sifflait et montrait ses crochets.","en":"The snake hissed and bared its fangs.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"snake"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"to show","l":"montrer"},{"g":"his"},null]}]}